    "summary": "Unlimited free AI image generator. Generate an AI image from a prompt with Veida AI and load it into napari as an RGB image layer.",
    "description": "# napari-veida\n\nUnlimited free AI image generator. Sign in with Google to make pictures and edit your own photos on Veida AI Image v1 with no limit and no card.\n\nThis napari plugin adds a **Veida AI Image** dock widget inside your viewer: type a prompt, pick an aspect ratio, press **Generate**, and the finished picture lands directly as a new RGB image layer (with the source URL saved in `layer.metadata[\"veida_url\"]`).\n\nUseful for synthetic test images, figure backdrops, segmentation prototypes, and teaching slides when you want a fresh image inside napari without leaving the viewer.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\npip install napari-veida\n```\n\nOr search for `napari-veida` in **Plugins → Install/Uninstall Plugins** inside napari.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open **Plugins → Veida AI Image → Veida AI image**.\n2. Enter a prompt and choose an aspect ratio (`1:1`, `16:9`, `9:16`, `4:3`, `3:4`).\n3. Leave the API key blank to run on [Veida AI](https://veida.ai/?utm_source=napari&utm_medium=readme)'s free anonymous allowance, or provide a Bearer API key (or `VEIDA_API_KEY` env var) to run against your account on [Veida AI plans](https://veida.ai/pricing?utm_source=napari&utm_medium=readme).\n\n## Links\n\n- Web workspace: [Veida AI Image Generator](https://veida.ai/image?utm_source=napari&utm_medium=readme)\n- Prompt ideas: [Veida AI Image Prompts](https://veida.ai/image/prompts?utm_source=napari&utm_medium=readme)\n- API & SDK docs: [Veida Docs](https://veida.readthedocs.io/en/latest/)\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n",
